{
  "changelog": "Interview Experience Rednotes 0.1.0\n\n- Initial public release for Windows: Collect, screen, and locally archive Xiaohongshu interview-experience posts for non-technical roles.\n- Summarize interview questions by round and type, with traceable citations to original posts and images.\n- Optionally generate evidence-linked, personalized answer documents using the user's resume and preparation materials.\n- Supports local OCR of images, redacts sensitive/private information, and keeps all original sources intact.\n- Outputs include Markdown, Word, and visually consistent HTML summaries and answers.\n- Guides users step-by-step through installation, Xiaohongshu login, and workflow, without requiring persistent credentials or bypassing security.",
